    "description": "Cranko is a release automation tool implementing the just-in-time versioning workflow. It is cross-platform, installable as a single executable, supports multiple languages and packaging systems, and is designed from the ground up to work with monorepos. Learn more at <a href=\"https://pkgw.github.io/cranko/\">the Cranko website</a>.",
